OL,3,GNEWSAFly-tipping left on road for more
OL,4,Athan a year
OL,5,
OL,6,FFour yellow skips, red sofas, old
OL,7,Fmattresses and bin bags have all been
OL,8,Fleft on the side of a residential road
OL,9,Fin Moseley, Birmingham, for more than a
OL,10,Fyear.
OL,12,FThe fly-tipping, which started after
OL,13,Fthree houses of multiple occupancy
OL,14,F(HMO) were shut down, has left some
OL,15,Fresidents on Park Road unable to sleep,
OL,16,Fout of fear it might be set alight.
OL,23,APub: 12-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,352,350,200,160,0,100
PN,35102
SC,0002
