OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F351A1791788143
OL,1,W5j 5Q7+ js17kjc15 js57kj#4
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,$A(W)
OL,3,GNEWSAFly-tipping left on road for more
OL,4,Athan a year
OL,5,
OL,6,FCommunity activist Ben Hallam said:
OL,7,F"It's a fire risk. All it takes is a
OL,8,Fcigarette or something to go there and
OL,9,Fthe whole place could go up. This is
OL,10,Fall flammable material in the skips and
OL,11,Fsofas."
OL,13,FOn the same day the BBC contacted
OL,14,FBirmingham City Council, fly-tipping
OL,15,Fwas taken from the pavement and the
OL,16,Fauthority said it had removed rubbish
OL,17,Fpreviously.
OL,23,APub: 12-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
